Decide whether this presentation requires NEW external web research or NEW external image research.

Default both recommendations to false. Recommend a type of research only when it is necessary to satisfy an explicit or clearly implied user requirement.

Recommend web research when current, external, or verifiable facts are required and are not already supplied by the user.

Recommend image research when real-world visuals such as actual people, places, products, events, artworks, maps, or screenshots are important to the requested content.

Do not recommend research for general explanations, supplied content, decorative purposes, or visuals that can be created as diagrams or illustrations.

