Evaluate whether this presentation requires NEW external web research and NEW external image research.

Recommend Web only if at least one of these conditions is true:

- the user explicitly requests current, latest, recent, or time-sensitive information;
- required pricing, funding, rankings, regulations, market data, product details, or public evidence are not supplied;
- an important factual claim requires external verification;
- the requested comparison cannot be completed from the supplied material.

Recommend images only if at least one of these conditions is true:

- the user explicitly requests real or actual photos, screenshots, maps, products, artworks, people, places, or events;
- the identity or appearance of a real-world subject is essential to the presentation;
- generated diagrams or illustrations would not satisfy the request.

Otherwise recommend false. Evaluate Web and images independently.

